<title>PORTUGAL: P.Telecom calls news conference Weds.</title>
<headline>P.Telecom calls news conference Weds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom (PT) said it called a news conference for Wednesday at 1800 GMT to be attended by Planning Minister Joao Cravinho and company chairman Fernando Murteira Nabo.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>But a company spokeswoman told Reuters earlier on Tuesday the company would be announcing details of its accord with Telefonica de Espana, which includes an exchange of shares.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
